    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "N\nNORTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nFlight\nSchedule\nEffective\nJanuary 31-\nApril 1,\n2000\nFor\nNonstop\nand Direct\nFlights\nPurchase tickets\nonline at\nwww.nwa.com\ncall Northwest\nAirlines at\n1-800-225-2525\nor call your\ntravel agent\nKLM\nNORTHWEST",
      "Florida\nGet Set to Dive into Fun\nFlorida offers fun for the whole family. World-\nfamous attractions in Orlando, sun-soaked beaches\nalong both coasts, the nonstop city of Miami and the\nlaid-back Florida Keys, plus much more.\nYou'll also receive more for your vacation dollar\nwhen you travel to Florida with Northwest Airlines\nWorldVacations —\n7 Specially priced air fare on Northwest Airlines\nA wide range of quality hotels at value prices\nFree or discounted admission to several\nattractions in Orlando\n' 500 WorldVacations WorldPerks® Bonus Miles, in\naddition to actual miles flown, with the purchase\nof an air and hotel package\nFor more information, call your\nprofessional travel agent or World Vacations at\n1-800-800-1504 or online at\nwww.nwa.com/vacpkg/\n©1999 Northwest Airlines Inc.\nNORTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nWorld Vacations™\nMP9487"
    ],
